        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. Effective January 1, 2006, the basic life coverage amount for eligible employees will be offered at no cost to the employee on the same basis as is offered to salaried employees, from year to year, for the duration of this contract, currently one (1) times annual base salary.",
